#. <CLT 4>えっと…これで腐川さんと葉隠クンから話は聞けたし、
#. この後はどうするかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Okay, so I've heard from Toko and Hiro. Umm...what\n"
"next?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう１度、<CLT><CLT 3>現場を調べておく<CLT><CLT 4>必要はあるだろうけど、
#. でも、それ以外にも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'll definitely have to look at the actual <CLT><CLT 3>crime\n"
"scene<CLT><CLT 4> again, but on top of that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>娯楽室に落ちていた<CLT><CLT 3>プロテインの容器<CLT><CLT 4>についても、
#. 詳しく調べておいた方がよさそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...maybe I should find out more about the <CLT><CLT 3>protein\n"
"can<CLT><CLT 4> we found on the floor of the rec room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>確か、<CLT><CLT 3>化学室<CLT><CLT 4>から持って来た物だったよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure it must have come from the <CLT><CLT 3>chem lab<CLT><CLT 4>...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. さてと…どこから始めるかな…？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So...where should I start?"
msgstr ""
